A quote follower below stacked quote openers in an item is read at its raw column

```
- > > +
> q
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <blockquote>
        <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
      </blockquote>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- > > +
  > q
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <blockquote><p>+
q</p></blockquote>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```
